ചായ വൈബ് (Chaya Vibe) — third-party assets

Fonts
- Noto Serif Malayalam — Google / Noto project, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt). github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notoserifmalayalam
- Chilanka — Santhosh Thottingal / Swathanthra Malayalam Computing, SIL Open Font License 1.1. github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/chilanka

Code
- Brush-stroke engine (engine.js) adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's Watercolor Brush style (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), under that repository's licence.
- Sound-effect helpers from the library's core/audio/sfx.py.

Voice
- Malayalam voice-over: Microsoft Azure neural voice ml-IN-MidhunNeural, generated through the free Microsoft Edge online text-to-speech service with the open-source edge-tts tool (github.com/rany2/edge-tts, LGPL-3.0). Use of the voice is subject to Microsoft's terms for that service; check them before commercial use. Script: voice/lines.json; generator: voice/gen.py.

Music and sound
- Original score composed for this film and synthesised in mix.py (guitar by Karplus–Strong, kalimba, flute, pad, bass). No samples, no licensed tracks.
- All sound effects (coins, glass, rain, pour, radio, crickets, bus horn, bike, clink) synthesised in mix.py.

Pictures
- Everything is drawn in code (brush strokes in a browser canvas). No photos, stock footage or generated images.
